### 1. Root route
GET http://localhost:3000/

### 2. About route (Student & Faculty Details)
GET http://localhost:3000/about

### 3. Debugging Fixes Checklist
GET http://localhost:3000/debug-fixes

### 4. GET all books (Default values: limit=10, offset=0, order_by=id, order=ASC)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/

### 5. Search books by title (search_q)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?search_q=the

### 6. Sort books by price descending (order_by & order)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?order_by=price&order=DESC

### 7. Filter books by price range (min_price & max_price)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?min_price=300&max_price=450

### 8. Combined search, filter, sort and pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?search_q=the&min_price=300&max_price=450&order_by=price&order=DESC&limit=5&offset=0

### 9. Pagination with limit and offset
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?limit=3&offset=3

### 10. GET one book by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1/

### 11. POST: Add a new book (Valid - 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Python Basics",
  "author": "John",
  "price": 350,
  "pages": 250
}

### 12. PUT: Update a book by ID (Valid - 200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone",
  "author": "J.K. Rowling",
  "price": 550,
  "pages": 350
}

### 13. DELETE: Remove a book by ID (200 OK)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/11/

### 14. GET: Non-existent book (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/999/

### 15. GET: Invalid book ID (400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/abc/

### 16. GET: Invalid order_by column (400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?order_by=rating

### 17. GET: Invalid order direction (400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?order=DOWN

### 18. GET: Invalid limit (400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?limit=-5

### 19. GET: Invalid price range where min > max (400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?min_price=500&max_price=200

### 20. POST: Validation failure - missing title (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "John",
  "price": 350
}

### 21. POST: Validation failure - non-numeric price (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Python Basics",
  "author": "John",
  "price": "three hundred"
}

### 22. PUT: Update non-existent book (404 Not Found)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/999/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost Book",
  "author": "Ghost",
  "price": 100
}

### 23. DELETE: Remove non-existent book (404 Not Found)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/999/

### 24. GET: Unknown route (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:3000/nothing

### 25. SQL Injection test - safe parameterized query
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?search_q=';DROP%20TABLE%20book;--
